  "body": "## Highlights\n\n* The artifacts built by Timoni are now reproducible across machines with different umasks and operating systems, as the file permissions in the content layers are set to `0755` for directories and owner-executable files and `0644` for other files, see [artifact](https://timoni.sh/concepts/#artifact).\n\n## Breaking changes\n\n* Modules and artifacts whose files carry other permissions, such as `0664` files and `0775` directories created with a `0002` umask or any content built on Windows, get a new digest the first time they are built with this version. Artifacts already published and the digests pinned in bundles are not affected. Publish the rebuilt content under a new version, as re-pushing an existing tag changes its digest.\n* Pulled files no longer keep restrictive permissions: files pushed as `0600` or `0444` are extracted as `0644`, and files executable only by group or others lose the execute bit.\n\n## What's Changed\n* test: replace Distribution with the go-containerregistry test registry by @stefanprodan in https://github.com/stefanprodan/timoni/pull/672\n* fix(oci): normalize file modes in artifact layers by @stefanprodan in https://github.com/stefanprodan/timoni/pull/673\n* build(deps): update Go dependencies, GitHub Actions and controller-gen by @stefanprodan in https://github.com/stefanprodan/timoni/pull/674\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/stefanprodan/timoni/compare/v0.36.0...v0.37.0\n\n\n",
